          {
            "index": 2692,
            "source_segment_index": 2692,
            "start_ms": 5204880,
            "end_ms": 5207340,
            "text": "来给各位大老师们做本九戏的复盘"
          },
          {
            "index": 2693,
            "source_segment_index": 2693,
            "start_ms": 5207340,
            "end_ms": 5210840,
            "text": "本局版型为玉女猎白混血儿"
          },
          {
